    "detailed_description": "<i><strong>The middle of the 23rd Century.</strong> A space probe detects unusual energy readings from the asteroid 2060 Chiron. A crewed follow-up mission detects a million-year-old artefact buried beneath the asteroid's surface. A ring of exotic matter that bends space and gravity. A <strong>Gate</strong>, which when activated could lead anywhere in the galaxy...</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE BEYOND THE GATE</h2><i><strong>Beyond the Chiron Gate</strong></i> is a text-based space exploration roguelike. Explore an endless universe filled with exotic planets, strange life forms, and ancient civilisations. Manage a crew of space explorers and upgrade their ship with new technology. Brave dangerous worlds to gather the data you need to reach the home system of the mysterious Gatebuilders.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Randomly-generated universe</strong> where no two games are the same.<br></li><li><strong>Over a hundred random events</strong> including perils on strange worlds, encounters with life and civilisations, and your explorers' emotional journeys.<br></li><li><strong>Multi-layered exploration</strong> where discoveries reveal more things to explore.<br></li><li><strong>Dozens of ship upgrades</strong> including scanners, defences, crew capacity increases, and new abilities.<br></li><li><strong>Six explorer classes</strong> that unlock new options in events. Explorers level up, can be injured or die, and can become inspired or depressed.<br></li><li><strong>Death is permanent</strong>. Take too many risks and the mission is over - start again in a new universe.<br></li><li>Post-victory <strong>endless mode.</strong><br></li><li>Over an hour of <strong>atmospheric space music.</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM THE CREATOR OF <i>SEEDSHIP</i></h2><i>Beyond the Chiron Gate</i> is the spiritual successor to the viral hit web/mobile game <i>Seedship</i>. Go beyond the Seedship's mission and explore a larger, more detailed universe.",
